# Windows command files reach every machine with Windows line endings, by a
# clone and by GitHub's "Download ZIP" alike. cmd.exe can lose its place in a
# file that has bare line feeds (a "goto" that lands nowhere), and a ZIP
# download is how a laptop with nothing installed gets this project.
# "-text": kept byte for byte as committed, which is with CR LF.
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
